  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/IMG_4633.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(167 fotos) Este domingo se han iniciado las exhibiciones taurinas en el barrio del Tossalet de Onda, con un toro homenaje a Jos&eacute; Segura Garc&iacute;a, fallecido prematuramente en el mes de mayo.&nbsp;Tambi&eacute;n ha habido tarde de vacas de Armando Beltr&aacute;n y se han embolado tres ejemplares.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeprimertossalet17/img_4608.jpg\" alt=\"img_4608\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeprimertossalet17/img_4609.jpg\" alt=\"img_4609\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeprimertossalet17/img_4610.jpg\" alt=\"img_4610\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeprimertossalet17/img_4611.jpg\" alt=\"img_4611\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeprimertossalet17/img_4612.jpg\" alt=\"img_4612\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeprimertossalet17/img_4613.jpg\" alt=\"img_4613\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeprimertossalet17/img_4615.jpg\" alt=\"img_4615\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeprimertossalet17/img_4616.jpg\" alt=\"img_4616\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeprimertossalet17/img_4617.jpg\" alt=\"img_4617\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\